    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000plrc](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000plrc) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jan 23 2025 10km W of Siocon. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 7.6743 longitude 122.0595. It impacted 189724 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
